        "data": {
          "text": "**Prediction (EoS):** λ_max rises progressively under full-batch GD, then self-stabilises at 2/η = 10.0. Loss decreases non-monotonically: once λ_max ≈ 10 the loss shows upward spikes (catapult oscillations). Gradient norm oscillates in sync. EoS holds universally for fixed LR + full-batch GD + no momentum.",
          "instanceTitle": "EoS / catapult hypothesis"
        },
        "parentId": null,
